%% TECH-024 Shared access checks
%% What a server action and a job route do first (R2, R3).
flowchart TD
    A[Server action] --> B[openAdminAction or openSiteAction]
    B --> C[Site cookie, else redirect to the password page]
    C --> D[Admin cookie, admin actions only, else redirect to /admin]
    D --> E{Write limit and Origin}
    E -- refusal --> F[The action answers with the text]
    E -- ok --> G[The action does its work]
    H[Job route: mails or cleanup] --> I[refuseJobCall]
    I --> J{Write limit}
    J -- over --> K[429]
    J -- ok --> L{Bearer secret, 32+ characters}
    L -- wrong or missing --> M[401]
    L -- right --> N[The job runs]
